### Takeaway

Point-forecast quality favors ElasticNet across all horizons, with performance gap widening at longer horizons (H3/H5). For alarm capture at `tau=15`, persistence remains competitive and often better in recall under the current top-k budget policy, especially at the 10% budget. This indicates model choice should depend on objective: choose ElasticNet for prediction accuracy, and validate persistence or hybrid ranking if maximizing event recall is the primary operational target.
